SUMMARY:New Date Fall Lighted Walking Trail Discounted + Dinner (Milton)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: The 10% off on the site may expire a
 t any time.\n\nOn **Friday October 23rd\,** **join us for Pumpkins After D
 ark in Milton.** Pumpkins After Dark **is Canada's award-winning outdoor H
 alloween event -** a family-friendly walk-through experience featuring mor
 e than 10\,000 hand-carved jack-o'-lanterns lighting up trails every fall.
  This event is available in Canada\, the United States\, and Ireland. Each
  season\, their team of artists hand-carves thousands of pumpkins\, builds
  themed scenes - from dinosaurs and dragons to pop-culture icons - and lig
 hts a glowing trail to wander together. No jump scares. Just craft\, wonde
 r\, and the warm glow of a thousand pumpkins. We will be seeing the **Show
  with the Maze** only. **Purchase your ticket for Pumpkins After Dark Show
  with the Maze on Friday October 23rd at 7:30pm.**\n\n**World Tour**\nTrav
 el the world through the eyes of Halloween with displays organized by cont
 inent. Pick up a passport and collect a stamp or letter in each continent 
 to spell a word.\n\n**Brand New Show**\nDiscover dancing leprechauns\, a l
 arger-than-life Eiffel Tower\, the Colosseum and Greek mythology\, a movin
 g windmill and Holland flower field\, Mount Scaremore\, and a moving aquar
 ium.\n\n**Pumpkinhead Ed Scavenger Hunt**\nPumpkinhead Ed has escaped and 
 is hiding on the grounds. Find Ed\, snap a photo\, and tag @findpumpkinhea
 ded for your chance to win a grand prize.\n\n**Interactive Fun**\nExplore 
 word searches\, puzzles\, pumpkin toss games\, a trick-or-treat area\, and
  stop by the Witches’ Brew to collect your slime bottle courtesy of The 
 Lab.\n\n**Great Photo Opportunities**\nMore photo opportunities this year
 —bigger and better. Share your best fall photo and tag #pumpkinsafterdar
 kmilton.\n\n**Costumed Actors**\n\n**WEATHER POLICY**:\n\n* This is an out
 door event and will run in the rain. The event may be cancelled in the eve
 nt of inclement weather\, unforeseen circumstances\, or other conditions t
 hat may impact safety. Ticket holders will be notified of any changes via 
 email\, which may occur without prior notice.\n\n**TRANSPORTATION**:\n\n* 
 Arrange for your own transportation. Feel free to post in the Comments if 
 you want/need to carpool.\n* **Carpool attendees MUST have a picture and a
 rrange a PUBLIC pick-up/ drop off spot for the security of members**. Any 
 risks associated with carpooling are borne by the member\, and Experience 
 Toronto cannot be held liable under any circumstances.\n\n**COST**\nGenera
 l Admission: Adult with Maze $34.95 + service fee + taxes\n\nDiscounted: $
 31.45 + service fee + taxes\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $10\n\nThere are no r
 efunds.\n\n***\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes** **with your cell and em
 ail (required for out of town events)**\; **everyone goes on the waitlist 
 until they post they have purchased their ticket and have transportation)*
 *\n* **[Purchase](https://milton.xpresstix.ca/)**[ ](https://www.tcomusic.
 ca/concert/opera-highlights-all-the-greatest-moments/#season-passes)**your
  own ticket for** **Pumpkins After Dark by going to the month of October\,
  selecting Friday October 23rd\, 7:30pm time slot and Adult with Maze for 
 $34.95\,** post you have purchased your ticket and have transportation\, a
 nd I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent 2 days before with
  my cell and details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior\,
  hoping there are still tickets\, and the Waitlist will be removed at that
  time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance
 .\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 7:25pm at Country Heritage Park at**\n
 **8560 Tremaine Rd\, Milton\, ON\, to the right of the entrance After scan
 ning your tickets. We will then head in together.**\n\n**Time: 7:30 - 10:3
 0pm** (people can leave whenever they wish)\n\n**Dinner: 8:45pm: I have ma
 de reservations for dinner a few mins away.** I hope you will join.\n\nEnj
 oy and please post your comments in the Event after.
